    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/e75b9fd6b9cf84900340f0226b7e7123.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a string of unsettling, cryptic murders lead Eddy, a broke, rundown journalist, to a seemingly remote mansion. Soon realizing he\u2019s not exactly alone in the mansion, Eddy must navigate the mansion, and solve puzzles to bring him closer to the truth\u2026 all while surviving whoever \u2013 or whatever \u2013 is there with him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/d73da0f7990d6b16eb5c92938c0ab141.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=75 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings, collect clues, and solve puzzles that will help bring Eddy closer to the truth.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/92cfc6a5cdcaf6e5f2f977b2e0cd0c87.poster.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/92cfc6a5cdcaf6e5f2f977b2e0cd0c87.webm?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/92cfc6a5cdcaf6e5f2f977b2e0cd0c87.mp4?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/81b6b728b65495fb55e090bb67f20db4.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cryptic murders aren\u2019t the only mystery in Eddy\u2019s life. As he spends more time in the mansion, he is forced to confront dark and personal questions about himself, and his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/4b8cf0065b5ae6a63280c48527a6bd6a.poster.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/4b8cf0065b5ae6a63280c48527a6bd6a.webm?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/4b8cf0065b5ae6a63280c48527a6bd6a.mp4?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/8aeb82cb6e5b1cac25278eb7a42b594f.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice caution when exploring your surroundings, you have a feeling you're not alone. Take advantage of the limited resources to aid you in survival while traversing the mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/5ae8be8e582311ebcfa2f9c2e5a3a608.poster.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/5ae8be8e582311ebcfa2f9c2e5a3a608.webm?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/5ae8be8e582311ebcfa2f9c2e5a3a608.mp4?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/e75b9fd6b9cf84900340f0226b7e7123.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a string of unsettling, cryptic murders lead Eddy, a broke, rundown journalist, to a seemingly remote mansion. Soon realizing he\u2019s not exactly alone in the mansion, Eddy must navigate the mansion, and solve puzzles to bring him closer to the truth\u2026 all while surviving whoever \u2013 or whatever \u2013 is there with him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/d73da0f7990d6b16eb5c92938c0ab141.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=75 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings, collect clues, and solve puzzles that will help bring Eddy closer to the truth.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/92cfc6a5cdcaf6e5f2f977b2e0cd0c87.poster.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/92cfc6a5cdcaf6e5f2f977b2e0cd0c87.webm?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/92cfc6a5cdcaf6e5f2f977b2e0cd0c87.mp4?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/81b6b728b65495fb55e090bb67f20db4.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cryptic murders aren\u2019t the only mystery in Eddy\u2019s life. As he spends more time in the mansion, he is forced to confront dark and personal questions about himself, and his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/4b8cf0065b5ae6a63280c48527a6bd6a.poster.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/4b8cf0065b5ae6a63280c48527a6bd6a.webm?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/4b8cf0065b5ae6a63280c48527a6bd6a.mp4?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/8aeb82cb6e5b1cac25278eb7a42b594f.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice caution when exploring your surroundings, you have a feeling you're not alone. Take advantage of the limited resources to aid you in survival while traversing the mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/5ae8be8e582311ebcfa2f9c2e5a3a608.poster.avif?t=1746169242\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/5ae8be8e582311ebcfa2f9c2e5a3a608.webm?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3100420/extras/5ae8be8e582311ebcfa2f9c2e5a3a608.mp4?t=1746169242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
